{"id":"20083cb2a7d8b906","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-family-fibration.md","title":"集合索引族","display":"df-family-fibration — 集合索引族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-family-fibration","display":"df-family-fibration — 集合索引族","depends_on":["[[16-df-set]]","[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]","[[16-df-fibration]]","[[16-df-split-fibration]]"],"source":"Definition 1.2.1, p. 32 (PDF 52); Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645); tagged-arrow encoding expanded locally","revision_date":"2026-10-16","aliases":["16-df-family-fibration"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-family-fibration"},{"key":"display","html":"df-family-fibration — 集合索引族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 1.2.1, p. 32 (PDF 52); Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645); tagged-arrow encoding expanded locally"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-family-fibration</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,J,K\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(I,J,K\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=(X_i)_{i\\in I}\">\\(X=(X_i)_{i\\in I}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y=(Y_j)_{j\\in J}\">\\(Y=(Y_j)_{j\\in J}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z=(Z_k)_{k\\in K}\">\\(Z=(Z_k)_{k\\in K}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>-小集合族。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=(I,X)\">\\(A=(I,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=(J,Y)\">\\(B=(J,Y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=(K,Z)\">\\(C=(K,Z)\\)</span> 表示下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 中的对象；总箭头带完整标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\">\\(\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\)</span>，在固定源靶时简写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,f):A\\to B\">\\((u,f):A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fib}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fib}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c9801f31ec8ac53f\" href=\"?note=c9801f31ec8ac53f\" title=\"16-df-fibration\">16-df-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" href=\"?note=eb3d8d8bfc151af6\" title=\"16-df-split-fibration\">16-df-split-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:I\\to J\">\\(u:I\\to J\\)</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}\">\\(f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}\\)</span> 均为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" href=\"?note=09b2ae01fb2d54e3\" title=\"16-df-set\">16-df-set</a> 中带源靶标签的集合箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ui\">\\(ui\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i(x)\">\\(f_i(x)\\)</span> 表示该三元箭头第三分量函数的取值，恒等与复合采用该范畴的运算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\in\\mathcal U^I\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O\n\\land u:I\\to J\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land f=(f_i)_{i\\in I}\n\\land(\\forall i\\in I)\\ f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,(\\operatorname{id}_{X_i})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,(g_{ui}\\circ f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad p_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\nu^*Y&amp;\\coloneqq(Y_{ui})_{i\\in I},\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u,(\\operatorname{id}_{Y_{ui}})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nO&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\in\\mathcal U^I\\},\\\\\nM&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O\n\\land u:I\\to J\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land f=(f_i)_{i\\in I}\n\\land(\\forall i\\in I)\\ f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,(\\operatorname{id}_{X_i})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,(g_{ui}\\circ f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&amp;\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad p_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\nu^*Y&amp;\\coloneqq(Y_{ui})_{i\\in I},\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u,(\\operatorname{id}_{Y_{ui}})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}))&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&amp;,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>函数的单位、结合律逐分量给出范畴公理。所选提升的分量全为恒等；因子逐分量唯一确定，故笛卡尔。预复合严格保持恒等与复合，提升也如此，因此指定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 是分裂。</li>\n<li>固定源靶后，箭头的笛卡尔性等价于所有分量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_i\">\\(f_i\\)</span> 可逆。每个纤维是集合族及逐点函数的范畴，通常不是预序。</li>\n<li>完整标签不可删：若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 非满射，箭头分量没有包含目标族在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\setminus u[I]\">\\(J\\setminus u[I]\\)</span> 上的数据，裸 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,f)\">\\((u,f)\\)</span> 因而不能决定靶对象。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, Definition 1.2.1, p. 32（PDF 52）；Definition 10.5.3, p. 625（PDF 645）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$；$\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 采用 [[16-df-set]]。$I,J,K\\in\\mathcal U$；$X=(X_i)_{i\\in I}$、$Y=(Y_j)_{j\\in J}$、$Z=(Z_k)_{k\\in K}$ 为 $\\mathcal U$-小集合族。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{Fib}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{Fib}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"c9801f31ec8ac53f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{Fib}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eb3d8d8bfc151af6","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cat}$、$\\mathrm{Functor}$、$\\mathrm{Fib}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)$ 分别采用 [[16-df-category]]、[[16-df-functor]]、[[16-df-fibration]]、[[16-df-split-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set","status":"resolved","id":"09b2ae01fb2d54e3","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$u:I\\to J$ 与每个 $f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}$ 均为 [[16-df-set]] 中带源靶标签的集合箭头；$ui$、$f_i(x)$ 表示该三元箭头第三分量函数的取值，恒等与复合采用该范畴的运算。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"I,J,K\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"X=(X_i)_{i\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"Y=(Y_j)_{j\\in J}","display":false},{"tex":"Z=(Z_k)_{k\\in K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"A=(I,X)","display":false},{"tex":"B=(J,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"C=(K,Z)","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"(u,f):A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"u:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}","display":false},{"tex":"ui","display":false},{"tex":"f_i(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nO&\\coloneqq\\{(I,X)\\mid I\\in\\mathcal U\\land X\\in\\mathcal U^I\\},\\\\\nM&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\mid A=(I,X)\\in O\\land B=(J,Y)\\in O\n\\land u:I\\to J\\\\\n&\\hspace{30mm}\\land f=(f_i)_{i\\in I}\n\\land(\\forall i\\in I)\\ f_i:X_i\\to Y_{ui}\\},\\\\\ns\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle&\\coloneqq A,\n\\qquad t\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq B,\\\\\ne(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle A,A,\\operatorname{id}_I,(\\operatorname{id}_{X_i})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\nc(\\langle B,C,v,g\\rangle,\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\langle A,C,vu,(g_{ui}\\circ f_i)_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U})&\\coloneqq\\langle O,M,s,t,e,c\\rangle,\\\\\np_0(I,X)&\\coloneqq I,\n\\qquad p_1\\langle A,B,u,f\\rangle\\coloneqq u,\n\\qquad p\\coloneqq\\langle p_0,p_1\\rangle,\\\\\nu^*Y&\\coloneqq(Y_{ui})_{i\\in I},\\\\\n\\kappa(u,(J,Y))&\\coloneqq\n\\langle(I,u^*Y),(J,Y),u,(\\operatorname{id}_{Y_{ui}})_{i\\in I}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}))&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathbf{Fam}(\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Fib}(p)&,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{SplitFib}(p,\\kappa).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"f_i","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"J\\setminus u[I]","display":false},{"tex":"(u,f)","display":false}],"bytes":3058,"backlinks":[{"id":"5bf8906d66a26c9e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以下具体公式专用于 [[16-df-family-fibration]] 的集合族纤维化。令 $D=I\\times J$、$V=(I\\times J)\\times J$；$Y,Z$ 是 $D$ 上的集合族，$f=(f_{(i,j)})_{(i,j)\\in D}$ 为从 $Y$ 到 $Z$ 的逐点集合箭头族。纤维对象使用 $(D,Y)$ 的完整标签，垂直箭头使用 $\\langle(D,Y),(D,Z),\\operatorname{id}_D,f\\rangle$。$\\mathsf E(Y)$ 是下式定义的 $V$ 上的族，$\\mathsf E(f)$ 是相应的逐点箭头族；$\\operatorname{id}_{\\varnothing}$ 为集合范畴中空集的恒等箭头。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-215","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-family-fibration|df-family-fibration — 集合索引族]]"}],"outgoing":["09b2ae01fb2d54e3","25a281534aa42440","fc49efccd7348d66","c9801f31ec8ac53f","eb3d8d8bfc151af6"]}